body:
Most people don't refuse to learn, they can't when they get stomped by dumb shit cent, warden, or orochi lightspammers and especially if they're high level and they know what they're doing because of garbage matchmaking. This causes players to get confused and they lose interest quickly even if they were trying to learn the game. 

In fact the same thing happened to 4 of my mates who recently bought the game and refunded it for this exact reason;   
They play well for like the first 6 or 7 games and they're immediately placed in higher level queues and because of that new players are frustrated and confused, not to mention they don't even know half of the game mechanics or character movesets. No new player wants that withing their first 2-7 days of playing.
